From 215a2ca2cc85e3d9c374d584bd7804598bdb02f3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Link Ganon Cape <infectiousmetal@live.se>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 03:17:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add a hood to Ganondorf's Cape for Link

A rigid hood made from the cape's material, drawn with the cape's own gMantDL
so it shares its texture and lighting. Its bottom row is the cape's strand
roots, so hood and cape share an edge. The head shell is baked from the
vanilla adult/child head meshes. While it's on, the cap's tail is hidden and
the cap dome in the head mesh is tinted with the hair color.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C7zQACRLFXxFtRaUPWxEdD
